\ ***************************************************************************
\ System: the keyboard, read from the System VIA as the OS's INKEY does,
\ so the game makes no OS calls once it owns the machine.
\ ***************************************************************************

\ Is a key down? X = internal key number. Z clear (BNE) if it is.
.key_down
    LDA #&7F : STA sysvia_ddra      ; bits 0-6 the key, bit 7 its state
    LDA #3 : STA sysvia_orb         ; auto-scan off: the matrix is ours
    STX sysvia_ora_nh
    LDA sysvia_ora_nh : AND #&80
    RTS

\ Is any key down, other than SHIFT, CTRL and the start-up links? Z clear if so.
.any_key
{
    LDX #&10
.scan
    JSR key_down : BNE done
    INX : BPL scan
    TAX                             ; (A = 0) Z set: none
.done
    RTS
}
